  "borough": "Harrow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal would fail to retain the character and appearance of the existing dwelling and the streetscene and would therefore fail to accord with National Planning Policy Framework (2023), Policy D3 of the London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1 (B) of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), policy DM1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed change of use, by reason of excessive activity would introduce a level of&amp;nbsp; activity and disturbance that would not be commensurate with the use of surrounding residential properties. The proposal would therefore be harmful to neighbouring residential amenities contrary to policies DM1, DM42 and DM46 of the Development Management Policies Local Plan 2013.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development by the introduction of an additional entrance door within the existing front elevation would appear at odds with the character and appearance of the dwellinghouse and surrounding pattern of development within the immediate area. As such, the development would be contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2023), Policy D3.D.11 of The London Plan (2021), DM1 of the Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
